[10.8,"o","\r\n\u001b[38;5;179m╭─ WHY THIS MATTERS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\u001b[0m\n\u001b[38;5;179m│ \u001b[0m💡 Here's the line that matters: the AI proposed this booking, but it\u001b[38;5;179m │\u001b[0m\n\u001b[38;5;179m│ \u001b[0m   cannot charge a cent without an explicit human yes. That approval \u001b[38;5;179m │\u001b[0m\n\u001b[38;5;179m│ \u001b[0m   gate is the trust model suppliers will require before letting     \u001b[38;5;179m │\u001b[0m\n\u001b[38;5;179m│ \u001b[0m   agents touch inventory.                                           \u001b[38;5;179m │\u001b[0m\n\u001b[38;5;179m╰───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\u001b[0m\r\n"]
